# Unreal Engine generated folders
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
.vs/

# Generated IDE files
*.sln
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb

# Note: Config/DefaultEditorPerProjectUserSettings.ini is deliberately NOT
# ignored - it carries the MCP auto-start server setting this project needs.

# Local operating-system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Track only content we author plus the small template content the game depends
# on. Everything else - the Laya Design kits from the Humble Massive Unreal
# Engine Bundle and any other Fab content - is large and re-downloadable from the
# Fab library, so it stays out of the repo. Restore it after cloning via the
# in-editor Fab plugin.
#
# /Content/Input IS TRACKED AND MUST STAY THAT WAY. It holds IMC_Default,
# IA_Move, IA_Look and friends. A project without them compiles and runs but the
# player cannot move or look - AddMappingContext silently receives null and the
# only symptom is a warning buried in the log. That cost a full project rebuild
# on 2026-07-29. Do not "tidy" these into the ignore list.
/Content/*
!/Content/Substrate/
!/Content/Substrate/**
!/Content/Input/
!/Content/Input/**
!/Content/FirstPerson/
!/Content/FirstPerson/**
!/Content/Characters/
!/Content/Characters/**
!/Content/LevelPrototyping/
!/Content/LevelPrototyping/**
!/Content/__ExternalActors__/
!/Content/__ExternalActors__/**
!/Content/__ExternalObjects__/
!/Content/__ExternalObjects__/**

# Local-only working files
Packaged/
Build/
build_log*.txt
_evidence/
_backups/
/*.log
/*.png

# Source audio copies the editor tracks for auto-reimport; the .uasset is what is versioned
/Content/Substrate/Audio/*.wav

# python helper scripts (_tools)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
